              <h1 class="mb-5" style="font-weight:900">TAIWAN GEODETIC MODEL</h1>
              <p class="p-2">TAIWAN GEODETIC MODEL (TGM) is a datacenter established to securely archive continuous GPS data and metadata gathered by IES, Academia Sinica, and provide transparent access to data for the geosciences research communities.</p>            
